# Generated from crates/ by `pnpm generate`; never merged by hand. `union` keeps both sides instead
# of stopping on a conflict, and the result is thrown away: regenerate after every merge.
# `pnpm check` and `pnpm check:rust` fail while one is stale. Hand-written files stay out of here.
packages/balance/balance.json linguist-generated text eol=lf merge=union
